stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: Open Home
  Loading --> First: Read succeeds with decisions
  Loading --> Empty: Read succeeds without decisions
  Loading --> Unavailable: Read fails
  Unavailable --> Loading: Retry
  First --> Later: Next mail
  Later --> Later: Next or Previous mail
  Later --> First: Previous mail reaches first page
  First --> Review: Open review
  Later --> Review: Open review
  Review --> First: Close review on first page
  Review --> Later: Close review on later page
  First --> Loading: Refresh
  Later --> Loading: Refresh
  Empty --> Loading: Refresh
  First --> Hidden: Hide or page hidden
  Later --> Hidden: Hide or page hidden
  Loading --> Hidden: Hide or page hidden
  Hidden --> Loading: Show
  Loading --> Retired: Authorization refused or sign out
  First --> Retired: Sign out
  Later --> Retired: Sign out
  Review --> Retired: Sign out
  Retired --> Retired: Late read completes
  Hidden --> Hidden: Late read completes
  Loading --> [*]: Unmount
  First --> [*]: Unmount
  Later --> [*]: Unmount
  %% never: Paging submits a decision or starts a read.
  %% never: Review loses its opener through paging, refresh or hide controls.
  %% never: Retirement or unmount restores rows after late completion.
